--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SUMMARY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Native SwiftUI parity of the "Helix natural-language dashboard composer" AI surface, built
from the AINLSqlPlayground template (same useAiStream + AIFeatureCard + withAiFeature
primitives, same captured-draft + propose-only "Apply to editor" flow) adapted for the
nl-dashboard-composer feature: POST /ai/power/dashboard/draft, tool_result
`draft_dashboard_layout`, and the nested typed `DashboardLayoutDraft` envelope
(dashboard {title, slots[{panel_name, grid_pos{x,y,w,h}}]} + referenced_panels) — the web
`parseDashboardLayoutDraft` / `onApply`. The LLM proposes a typed dashboard JSON draft built
from the curated panel catalog; it never pushes to Grafana (ADR-015 §I8 propose-only).

Files shipped (12): AINLDashboardComposer.{Adapter,Logic,Model,Source,Views,Chrome}.swift,
AINLDashboardComposer.swift, AINLDashboardComposer.Previews.swift, AINLDashboardComposer.strings,
AINLDashboardComposer.Tests.swift, AINLDashboardComposer.ModelTests.swift,
AINLDashboardComposer.AdapterTests.swift.

States reproduced (all render; none hidden): gateLoading (skeleton), ready/idle invite,
streaming (Helix thinking), rationale (delta accumulation), draft-ready (captured
DashboardLayoutDraft -> proposed-dashboard preview: title + panel-slot list with W×H/grid
placement + referenced-panel chips + "Apply to editor"), stream error, gateError (QueryError
peer + retry), stale (+ one-shot auto-refresh) / offline (cached + disabled), gatedOff
(renders nothing = web withAiFeature -> null).

Data binding: NLDashboardComposerModel (P1/S8 state-holder seam); no HTTP in the view.
i18n: P1/S10 facade (NLDashboardComposerStrings), table "AINLDashboardComposer"; 8 source keys
(title/description/button/badge/promptPlaceholder/promptLabel/applyButton/applyTooltip) + shared
Helix scaffold keys + native chrome keys; no English literals in Swift.
Telemetry: view.opened with slug "AINLDashboardComposer" (P1/S11).
Charts/maps: none (this surface has no chart or map; Swift Charts / MapKit not required).

